### Prakriti Assessment Diagnostic Questionnaire APIs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. List all Prakriti Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions

### 2. Add New Prakriti Question (From Screenshot Reference: Body Frame & Skeletal Build)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_text": "Which statement best describes your natural body frame and skeletal build?",
  "is_active": true,
  "options": [
    {
      "option_text": "Thin, tall or short, lean, joints easily click or crack",
      "dosha_weight": { "vata": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Medium build, good muscle tone, joints are moderate and flexible",
      "dosha_weight": { "pitta": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Broad, heavy skeletal frame, tends to gain weight easily, sturdy joints",
      "dosha_weight": { "kapha": 3 }
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Add Another Predefined Question (Skin Texture)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_text": "Touch your arm and face. What describes your skin quality best?",
  "is_active": true,
  "options": [
    {
      "option_text": "Dry, rough, cool to touch, easily chapped, thin skin",
      "dosha_weight": { "vata": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Warm, soft, oily in T-zone, prone to redness, moles/freckles or acne",
      "dosha_weight": { "pitta": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Thick, oily, cool, smooth, soft, well-hydrated and glowing",
      "dosha_weight": { "kapha": 3 }
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Get Question By ID
# Replace :id with actual ID from previous response
GET {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions/1

### 5. Update Question (Add/Replace Options)
# Replace :id with actual ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_text": "Which statement best describes your natural body frame and skeletal build?",
  "is_active": true,
  "options": [
    {
      "option_text": "Thin, tall or short, lean, joints easily click or crack",
      "dosha_weight": { "vata": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Medium build, good muscle tone, joints are moderate and flexible",
      "dosha_weight": { "pitta": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Broad, heavy skeletal frame, tends to gain weight easily, sturdy joints",
      "dosha_weight": { "kapha": 3 }
    },
    {
      "option_text": "Mixed build, hard to tell",
      "dosha_weight": { "vata": 1, "pitta": 1, "kapha": 1 }
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Add a Single Option to a Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions/1/options
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "option_text": "Extremely tall and heavily built",
  "dosha_weight": { "kapha": 2, "vata": 1 }
}

### 7. Remove/Deactivate Question (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions/1

### 8. Hard Delete Question (Permanent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/prakriti-questions/1?permanent=true
